  "evidenceRules": [
    "Receipt MAC authenticates prober observation and returned device signature bytes, never the device key.",
    "Device signatures must be checked against the immutable runtime signer.",
    "Pair halves are joined only after matching separately issued descriptors and both runtime signatures; direct completion is bidirectional.",
    "Device-reported cleanup and router responses are not external path evidence.",
    "Direct and relay use separate signed and receipt domains.",
    "Unknown fields, versions, modes and outcomes refuse.",
    "Capability, experiment and cleanup-reserve ceilings may be reduced by a frozen profile and never expanded.",
    "Endpoint registration and pair transports are pair-only; router mutation is mapping-only.",
    "Consent is consumed by the existing issuer once; this pure codec supplies no stateful replay/accounting owner."
